{
  "configuration_id": "config_036",
  "reason": "The current best (config_028: scvi_n200 + resnet50 + avgpool + weighted, acc=0.678) clearly establishes scvi_n200 as the superior RNA encoder and avgpool+weighted as the best aggregation/fusion pair. The key remaining uncertainty is the image encoder choice: resnet50 has only 2 data points (0.639, 0.678) vs. imagenet_vit_l with 5 (0.507–0.635). Config_036 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + avgpool + weighted + multiprofile) directly tests whether the larger ViT-L image encoder, when paired with the best RNA encoder and proven aggregation/fusion, can match or exceed resnet50. This is the highest-impact untested combination: if imagenet_vit_l performs comparably or better, it opens a new optimization axis; if it underperforms, it confirms resnet50 is optimal and the last 2 experiments can focus on fine-tuning around the resnet50+scvi_n200 core. This single test resolves the most important remaining design uncertainty before the budget ends."
}

